OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFine and sunny for the most
OL,6,Fpart on Thursday, after a cool
OL,7,Fmorning. Clouding over by late
OL,8,Fafternoon or evening, ahead of rain
OL,9,Fand stronger winds spreading east
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with rain spreading
OL,13,Feastwards through the region overnight
OL,14,Fwith strengthening winds. The rain
OL,15,Fwill clear from the west but linger
OL,16,Falong the east coast by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
